  "sourceTitle": "shardr — like docker for models, BitTorrent sync, OpenAI-compatible serving, inference engines from upstream.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d99b9854420fd32384e813a3bcb44c26796347e8d57e36e6778c3dc24a35cf81",
